# Auto-import namespace for NMBL security/staged-boot NixOS modules.
#
# `../default.nix` imports every `*.nix` dropped here. The later vertical
# slices land their option modules in this directory and self-register with
# zero shared-line edits (FIX-60):
#   #6  signing.nix       boot.nmbl.signing.{enable,enforce,publicKeys,…}
#   #7  tpm.nix           boot.nmbl.tpm.{measure,requireTpm,…} + early-load
#   #8  driver-image.nix  boot.nmbl.driverImages.*
#   #9  staged-boot.nix   boot.nmbl.staged.*
#   #10 secure-boot.nix   boot.nmbl.secureBoot.*
#
# This placeholder keeps the directory present so the skeleton builds with no
